      "quote": "",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "空行。"
    },
    {
      "at": 89,
      "quote": "const uint64_t transactionMs = to_ms(std::chrono::steady_clock::now() - startTime);",
      "kind": "data",
      "text": "**算本次事务耗时**。"
    },
    {
      "at": 90,
      "quote": "if (transactionMs > 1000lu) {",
      "kind": "branch",
      "text": "**超过 1 秒**。"
    },
    {
      "at": 91,
      "quote": "ALOGW(\"Binder transaction to %s, function: %s, took %\" PRIu64",
